# A single unit-ish cube centered at the origin, half-size 0.6.
# Hand-authored, not downloaded: 8 vertices, 12 triangles (2 per face),
# wound counter-clockwise as seen from outside each face so face_normal()
# points outward. Used for the wireframe and single-object flat-shading
# demos, where there's only one convex object so no depth conflicts arise.
v -0.6 -0.6 -0.6
v 0.6 -0.6 -0.6
v 0.6 0.6 -0.6
v -0.6 0.6 -0.6
v -0.6 -0.6 0.6
v 0.6 -0.6 0.6
v 0.6 0.6 0.6
v -0.6 0.6 0.6
f 1 4 3
f 1 3 2
f 5 6 7
f 5 7 8
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
f 4 8 7
f 4 7 3
f 1 5 8
f 1 8 4
f 2 3 7
f 2 7 6
